# Wartime Protestors {3}{R} (Human Rebel Ally 4/4, haste): "Whenever another Ally you control enters, put a +1/+1 counter on that creature
# and it gains haste until end of turn." Turn 1: entering itself gives it nothing, and neither does Ornithopter (not an Ally). Turn 2:
# Bot2's Invasion Reinforcements is an Ally under the other player, so it gets no counter. Turn 3: Bot1's Invasion Reinforcements and the
# Ally token it makes are two Allies: each gets a +1/+1 counter (2/2 each) and haste, so the token attacks the turn it enters for 2 (Bot2
# 20 -> 18). Turn 5: the haste has ended (the counter stays).

